From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <escapea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 01:30:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] test(harness): re-home the ui-theme baseline onto the fork
 tree

Upstream 0.7.36 adds scripts/ui-theme-harness.mjs plus a baseline of 1033
existing style-debt declarations and runs it from harness:check. The fork tree
differs from upstream (group chat / workflow / apirelay pages removed, own
components added), so the inherited baseline reports 265 findings: 209 stale
entries for files the fork deleted and 56 entries for fork-owned components.

Re-home rather than expand: drop the entries for deleted files, keep every
upstream entry whose value still exists, and register the fork's pre-existing
findings. Every remaining line traces back to either the upstream baseline or a
measurement of the pre-upgrade fork tree, so this patch introduces no new debt.
---
 scripts/ui-theme-baseline.json | 284 ++++++++-------------------------
 1 file changed, 63 insertions(+), 221 deletions(-)

